    .suffix = Single
ent-AloeCream = 蘆薈乳霜 | aloe cream
    .desc = 一種用於燒傷的外用乳膏。 | A topical cream for burns.
    .suffix = { ent-Ointment.suffix }
ent-HealingToolbox = 療癒工具箱 | healing toolbox
    .desc = 一個蘊含強大能量的強大工具箱。它既能治癒你的傷口，也能讓你充滿殺意。 | A powerful toolbox imbued with robust energy. It can heal your wounds and fill you with murderous intent.
